## AI Agent Reasoning

### Context
PR #48 renumbered an already-applied Drizzle migration, causing upgrades from main to recreate the ticket_replies table and fail.

### Decisions Made
- Restore 0002_new_magneto byte-for-byte with its original journal timestamp because released migrations are immutable.
- Move ticket creator attribution to 0003 and chain its snapshot from the restored 0002 snapshot.
- Add a regression test for the released migration filename, timestamp, and SQL hash.

### Trade-offs
- The regression test intentionally couples to the released artifact so accidental migration rewrites fail immediately.
